{
  "uid": "yuyu-resources",
  "title": "Yuyu Resource History",
  "description": "Application totals, usage versus limits, service health, worker freshness, storage allocation and shared-server resources.",
  "tags": [
    "yuyu",
    "resources"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "editable": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Yuyu services and scope",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**yuyu** = web app \u00b7 **yuyu-postgres** = database \u00b7 **yuyu-redis** = rate limiting \u00b7 **yuyu-garage** = private storage + HTTPS proxy \u00b7 **yuyu-outbox** = scheduled email worker.\n\nTotals include running Yuyu containers. Limits are configured ceilings, not reserved capacity. The short-lived outbox job may finish between scrapes; use its last-success panel to check it. Server charts include other applications. History retention: **90 days or 20 GB**, whichever comes first."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Yuyu CPU now",
      "description": "",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"yuyu\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cores",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
